Installing Games::Sokoban::Solver
=================================

    perl Makefile.PL
    make            (gmake on Windows with Strawberry Perl)
    make test
    make install

Prerequisites: perl 5.42 or later with 64-bit integers, and the CPAN module
Array::Heap.  The BerkeleyDB module is optional; without it the program runs
its searches in memory only.

Running the tests needs no network and no database; they take under two
minutes.

A NOTE FOR THE AUTHOR'S MACHINE

The Sokoban project this distribution comes from puts its own library
directory on PERL5LIB, and that directory holds a Games/Sokoban/Solver.pm
which is NOT this distribution's main module (it is the project's optimal
solver).  PERL5LIB comes before the site library in @INC, so an installed
Games::Sokoban::Solver would be shadowed there.  Run the distribution from its
own tree with PERL5LIB empty:

    $env:PERL5LIB = ''
    perl -Ilib bin/soko-solver.pl levels.xsb
    prove -l t

or remove the Sokoban entries from PERL5LIB before installing.
